<!-- Ground unit kill scoring (D-049): Light Tank 1, Medium Tank 2, Heavy Tank 2 (design/WW2-WitM-Territory-WarLevel-Design.md). Armored Car scores 0, so it has no group. Attach with [TriggerGroups:WW2-Points-Group-{Side}-{Type}]. -->
		<EntityComponent xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_InventoryComponentDefinition">
			<Id>
				<TypeId>Inventory</TypeId>
